        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises DS-56 Lion Head Pedestal Door Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\nIncredibly detailed Lion Head pedestal style floor mount door stop is forged of solid brass and available in 5 high quality finishes. It is equally suited for use in your private residence or office building. The master sculptor did an amazing job creating this decorative lions face. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-5010-size.gif?v=1704354743\" width=\"250\" heaight=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"lion head door stop picture\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe lion head door stop is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the door knob or lever as well.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOnly one hole to drill makes installation fast and easy.  Packaged with mounting hardware.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Field Enterprises DS-56 Lion Head Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Floor to Bumper Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Ring: Black Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Hardware:  #12 x 1-1/2\" screw</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Lion Head Pedestal Door Stop, Field Enterprises DS-56",
                "description": "Field Enterprises DS-56 - Incredibly detailed Lion Head pedestal style floor mount door stop is forged of solid brass and available in 5 high quality finishes. It is equally suited for use in your private residence or office building. The master sculptor did an amazing job creating this decorative lions face. ",
